Z||000000||sluppy123||06-26-2000||11:00 PM||||Well having just gotten my Freshly painted 87' GT back to show condition, I decided to see how she would do against some high $$$ competition. I entered her in a large local car show in the 69'-00' sports car class. I was stuck with some very unfair competition, Porsche 911, BMW M5, ZR1 Vett...ect<P>But In the end I came in Second, Not bad for a $8,000 orphaned Late 80's Sports car uh??<BR>A BMW M5 won first<P>Here's some pics of the the car and her sister<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=6751238&p=23380894&Sequence=0"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=6751238&p=23381007&Sequence=0"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="Http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=6751238&p=23381100&Sequence=0"> <P><BR>||||reg||10
