Z||000006||sluppy123||06-27-2000||05:19 PM||||The front chin spoiler is from RSM along with the side scoops. I had no problems with the chin spoiler fitting but it is very thin in some spots, I plan on re-glassing the entire thing for strength. <P>But I would <B>NEVER, EVER</B> Buy the Side scoops again, atleast not from RSM, One fit OK But the driver side was way off, (warped) Took forever to get it to fit  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>-Brian||||reg||1
